From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ayman <ayman@pipa>
Subject: [PATCH] Input: nanosic_803: include linux/hex.h for hex_to_bin

On Linux 7.1.x, hex_to_bin() is declared in include/linux/hex.h and is no
longer pulled in transitively. Include it explicitly so nanosic_803 builds.
---
 drivers/input/keyboard/nanosic_803.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/input/keyboard/nanosic_803.c b/drivers/input/keyboard/nanosic_803.c
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/drivers/input/keyboard/nanosic_803.c
+++ b/drivers/input/keyboard/nanosic_803.c
@@ -14,6 +14,7 @@
 #include <linux/input/mt.h>
 #include <linux/interrupt.h>
 #include <linux/kernel.h>
+#include <linux/hex.h>
 #include <linux/log2.h>
 #include <linux/module.h>
 #include <linux/of.h>
--
2.47.1
